// Duel: one NPC fights you at a time and keeps the fight until it dies, breaks off or turns on someone else.
// The others wait on a wide ring (attack reach + 600 units), falling back to it first, and circle there out of the
// way. A waiting NPC you hit fights back for a moment. Bosses never wait, and archers and mages at range aren't
// paced, so they still shoot and cast.
// A preset resets the tuning to the defaults, then applies these values (names as in EnhancedCombatBehavior.ini).
{
    "CombatPacing": {
        "EnableCombatPacing": true,
        "MaxSimultaneousAttackers": 1,
        "SlotWindowMinSeconds": 600,
        "SlotWindowMaxSeconds": 600,
        "WaitDistanceMargin": 600
    }
}
